msgid ""
"E.g. Attending your child's school for diabetes management or your child "
"being sent home because of diabetes-related illness."
msgstr ""
"E.e. Mynd i ysgol eich plentyn ar gyfer rheoli diabetes neu eich plentyn yn "
"cael ei anfon adref oherwydd salwch sy'n gysylltiedig â diabetes."

