"37. How often do you feel anxiety or stress related to your diabetes while "
"you're at school?"
msgstr ""
"37. Pa mor aml wyt ti'n teimlo pryder neu straen sy'n gysylltiedig â dy "
"ddiabetes pan rwyt ti yn yr ysgol?"

